  "sourceTitle": "Miniature Cheesecakes",
  "sourceText": "Miniature Cheesecakes\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 11:32pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n16 ounces Cream cheese\n3/4 cup Sugar\n2 Eggs\n1 teaspoon Vanilla\nCherry pie filling\nVanilla wafers\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream cheese, sugar, eggs and vanilla together. Fill muffin pan with bake cups; place vanilla wafer at bottom of each. Fill half full of batter and bake 10 minutes or until set. Top with pie filling.",
